#6003
On Top of the Field Wall~
   From the top of the old wall you can see the whole valley: grey fields,
the dark bulk of the granary, the fort's towers to the south. To the west,
beyond the walls of Midgaard, the sky is stained a sickly brown that the
farmers will not talk about.
