#6004
The Requisition Post~
   A timber hut with a counter across its front where farmers hand over
their harvest. A soldier weighs each sack on a great iron scale while a
clerk writes in a ledger. Nobody is paid. A list of hoarders hangs beside
the door, and some names have been crossed through in red.
~
