#6005
The Farmhouse Yard~
   A yard of packed earth between a long stone farmhouse and a sagging barn.
Chickens scratch in the dirt, and a dog on a chain watches you without
barking. The farmhouse windows are boarded, and a child's face appears at a
crack and vanishes.
