#6019
The Granary Yard~
   The great granary rises above the yard, a windowless barn of grey stone
raised on squat pillars against damp and vermin. The pillars have not
stopped the vermin. Soldiers guard the doors, but they stand well back from
them and do not like the sounds inside.
