#6020
Inside the Great Granary~
   Mountains of grain rise into the darkness, the stores that keep the fort
alive through winter. The smell hits first: sweet, wet rot. The grain shifts
and whispers on its own, and in the gloom, small red eyes watch from every
slope of it.
